WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling Chamber of Unkept Vows, desperate.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.300 align:center
Lyra: No! Get off!

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:07.600 align:center
Echo Shard: Release it. Forget.

4
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.900 align:center
Lyra: Never! This is mine!

5
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.200 align:center
Kael: A promise... fragile.

6
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Shard-Vein Labyrinth, tense.

7
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:17.800 align:center
Lyra: Almost... there!

8
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.100 align:center
Kael: Hold fast... to what?

9
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.400 align:center
Lyra: Everything. This is everything.

10
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.700 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Edge of the Void, desperate.

11
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.000 align:center
Lyra: No choice. Forgive me.

12
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.300 align:center
Kael: The cost... always.

13
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:31.600 align:center
Lyra: Run!

14
00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:36.900 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in The Fields of Broken Pledges, dread.

15
00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.200 align:center
Lyra: What... is that?

16
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.500 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Release. It is lost.

17
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:41.800 align:center
Kael: Broken pledges... everywhere.

18
00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.100 align:center
Lyra: Not me. Not now.

19
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:49.400 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in The Chasm of Regret, desperate.

20
00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:51.700 align:center
Lyra: Too wide! Too far!

21
00:00:51.1000 --> 00:00:53.1000 align:center
Kael: Regret... a deep fall.

22
00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:56.300 align:center
Lyra: No. Not this shard. Not yet.

23
00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:01.600 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in The Crumbling Bridge of Unfulfilled Intentions, urgent.

24
00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:02.900 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Inevitability.

25
00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.200 align:center
Lyra: Damn it! Move!

26
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.500 align:center
Kael: It fades... with me.

27
00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:07.800 align:center
Lyra: Just hold on!

28
00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:13.100 align:center
♪ at dusk, in The Maze of Wavering Loyalties, dread.

29
00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:15.400 align:center
Lyra: Which way? It shifts!

30
00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:16.700 align:center
Kael: Loyalty... betrayed.

31
00:01:16.1000 --> 00:01:18.1000 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Why resist? It is calm.

32
00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:20.300 align:center
Lyra: Lies! Always lies!

33
00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:25.600 align:center
♪ at dusk, in The Nexus Approach - Fading Hope, desperate.

34
00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:26.900 align:center
Lyra: Can't... stop...

35
00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:28.200 align:center
Kael: Hope... a flicker.

36
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:29.500 align:center
Lyra: Almost... there!

37
00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:34.800 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Nexus - Ambush, dread.

38
00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:36.100 align:center
Lyra: No! A trap!

39
00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:37.400 align:center
Kael: Not this... again.

40
00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:38.700 align:center
Silence Entities: Welcome. To stillness.

41
00:01:38.1000 --> 00:01:39.1000 align:center
Lyra: Get back!

42
00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:46.300 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Nexus Core - Last Stand, desperate.

43
00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:48.600 align:center
Lyra: Too many! I can't!

44
00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:50.900 align:center
Kael: Last stand... for her.

45
00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:53.200 align:center
Silence Entities: Relinquish. Your purpose ends.

46
00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:55.500 align:center
Lyra: No! Not like this!

47
00:01:56.800 --> 00:02:00.800 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Consumed Nexus, dread.

48
00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:03.100 align:center
Lyra: You want it? Take it!

49
00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:04.400 align:center
Kael: Gone... all gone.

50
00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:06.700 align:center
Silence Entities: Interesting. A new path.

51
00:02:06.1000 --> 00:02:08.1000 align:center
Lyra: What have I done?
